NOTICE OF FILING AMENDED (UNREDACTED) PUBLIC DIRECT TESTIMONY OF
                       MICHAEL P. GORMAN

       Pursuant to the Order Granting Motion to Withdraw Confidential Testimony and Refile

Testimony, issued on November 18, 2026, and consistent with the Joint Stipulated Resolution filed

on October 28, 2026, and the Motion to Withdraw Confidential Testimony and File Amended

Public Testimony of Michael P. Gorman filed on October 28, 2026, and the Joint Explanation filed

on November 19, 2026, the Regents of the State University of New Mexico ("NMSU") hereby

notifies the New Mexico Public Regulation Commission and the parties in this case of the filing

on November 19, 2026 of the Amended (Unredacted) Public Direct Testimony of Michael P.

Gorman. The Amended (Unredacted) Public version of Mr. Gorman's Direct Testimony contains

only the following amendments from the Public (redacted) version of Mr. Gorman's Direct

Testimony filed on October 23, 2026:

      The cover page identifies the testimony as the Amended (Unredacted) PUBLIC Direct

       Testimony of Michael P. Gorman, and that it was filed on November 19, 2026.

      The Table of Contents identifies the testimony as the Amended (Unredacted) PUBLIC

       Direct Testimony of Michael P. Gorman, and deletes the reference to CONFIDENTIAL

       Exhibit MPG-21, which was an error in the Table of Contents in the original version of

       Mr. Gorman's Public Direct Testimony filed on October 23, 2026.
       The header on each page of the testimony identifies it as the Amended (Unredacted)

       PUBLIC Direct Testimony of Michael P. Gorman.

      The title on the first page of the body of the testimony identifies it as the Amended

       (Unredacted) PUBLIC Direct Testimony of Michael P. Gorman.

      Lines 22-13 and lines 15-35 on page 22 are unredacted.

      Footnotes 10 and 11 on page 22 and footnotes 15, 16, and 17 on page 27 delete reference

       to CONFIDENTIAL Exhibit MPG-21.

      Table 5 on page 25 is unredacted.

      Lines 3-8 on page 27 are unredacted.

       There are no other amendments to the Public Direct Testimony of Michael P. Gorman.

NMSU notes that the Order Granting Motion to Withdraw Confidential Testimony and Refile

Testimony granted NMSU's Motion and withdrew the Confidential Direct Testimony and Exhibits

of Michael P. Gorman, thus NMSU understands that it need take no further action to withdraw Mr.

Gorman's Confidential Direct Testimony and Exhibits.

